{"4796520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Counter Ducks", "steam_appid": 4796520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4981460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit the Duck's Eye Lake Reserve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side—become the hunter or the hunted. But in this conflict, who is truly the predator, and who is the prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/3bc7d623e5491fa9e5bd1e5e3522fd8c.poster.avif?t=1788099632\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/3bc7d623e5491fa9e5bd1e5e3522fd8c.webm?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/3bc7d623e5491fa9e5bd1e5e3522fd8c.mp4?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, ducky, ducky...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your equipment and skills to achieve your objective as quickly as possible. As the Hunter, hunt the ducks down before they get to you. Defend the buildings at all costs. If they fall, there'll be nothing left for you to come back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/58aa4917850ea0cf491f74ce150a0af1.poster.avif?t=1788099632\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/58aa4917850ea0cf491f74ce150a0af1.webm?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/58aa4917850ea0cf491f74ce150a0af1.mp4?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the preda... duck.<strong> </strong>Hunt the hunters. Blend into the flock and strike when they least expect it, or rely on years of preparation and take them head-on. Destroy the buildings the hunters dared to build on your land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/8cca11cca143403b3ad2f9009bb7a41c.poster.avif?t=1788099632\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/8cca11cca143403b3ad2f9009bb7a41c.webm?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/8cca11cca143403b3ad2f9009bb7a41c.mp4?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never forget: this is your home. Humans are only guests.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit the Duck's Eye Lake Reserve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side—become the hunter or the hunted. But in this conflict, who is truly the predator, and who is the prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/3bc7d623e5491fa9e5bd1e5e3522fd8c.poster.avif?t=1788099632\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/3bc7d623e5491fa9e5bd1e5e3522fd8c.webm?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/3bc7d623e5491fa9e5bd1e5e3522fd8c.mp4?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, ducky, ducky...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your equipment and skills to achieve your objective as quickly as possible. As the Hunter, hunt the ducks down before they get to you. Defend the buildings at all costs. If they fall, there'll be nothing left for you to come back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/58aa4917850ea0cf491f74ce150a0af1.poster.avif?t=1788099632\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/58aa4917850ea0cf491f74ce150a0af1.webm?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/58aa4917850ea0cf491f74ce150a0af1.mp4?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the preda... duck.<strong> </strong>Hunt the hunters. Blend into the flock and strike when they least expect it, or rely on years of preparation and take them head-on. Destroy the buildings the hunters dared to build on your land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/8cca11cca143403b3ad2f9009bb7a41c.poster.avif?t=1788099632\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/8cca11cca143403b3ad2f9009bb7a41c.webm?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796520/extras/8cca11cca143403b3ad2f9009bb7a41c.mp4?t=1788099632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never forget: this is your home. Humans are only guests.</p>", "short_description": "Asymmetrical 